WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
The Magical Revolution

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
The Magical Revolution

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

00:07.570 --> 00:08.520
Who is it?

00:11.200 --> 00:12.810
I came over to play!

00:14.010 --> 00:15.750
Again?

00:15.750 --> 00:17.160
You're gonna get in trouble.

00:17.160 --> 00:18.640
It'll be fine!

00:18.640 --> 00:20.620
C'mon, let's do some experiments!

00:23.930 --> 00:26.200
Are you sure it'll be all right this time?

00:26.200 --> 00:29.030
O-Of course! My theory's perfect!

00:29.030 --> 00:30.350
Is it really?

00:30.350 --> 00:31.210
Yes, it is!

00:31.510 --> 00:34.920
You said that last time, 
and then there was a huge explosion.

00:34.920 --> 00:37.350
Even I got in trouble with Father.

00:37.350 --> 00:40.150
We'll be okay this time! 
It'll work for sure!

00:40.150 --> 00:43.360
No. I'm not hanging out with you anymore.

00:43.650 --> 00:45.560
You don't even feel bad about what happened.

00:48.470 --> 00:49.760
Okay, I get it!

00:50.480 --> 00:53.770
What happened last time 
was my fault! I'm sorry!

00:54.880 --> 00:56.070
So...

01:00.090 --> 01:01.990
Let's shake hands and make up!

01:07.750 --> 01:11.720
Well, I guess I can play along 
with you for a <i>little</i> bit.

01:11.720 --> 01:13.670
Yeah! Thanks!

01:17.220 --> 01:19.170
Let's go, Al!

01:28.060 --> 01:32.020
<i>I still remember how warm her hand felt.</i>

01:33.780 --> 01:34.970
<i>Which is why...</i>

01:35.520 --> 01:37.600
<i>I still can't forget how cold it felt</i>

01:38.500 --> 01:40.670
<i>when our hands separated, either.</i>

01:49.380 --> 01:50.910
Water Cutter!

01:59.630 --> 02:01.080
Water Lance!

02:07.150 --> 02:08.930
Icicle Prison!

02:20.620 --> 02:22.590
Water Hammer!

02:37.980 --> 02:38.850
Al!

02:43.260 --> 02:44.670
You're not afraid at all.

02:45.240 --> 02:47.550
You need to stop taking me so lightly!

02:49.310 --> 02:51.320
<i>The super-regeneration of a vampire...</i>

02:51.740 --> 02:53.030
<i>That's gonna be trouble.</i>

02:54.140 --> 02:55.690
Water Bullet!

02:59.600 --> 03:00.740
Ice?

03:09.090 --> 03:12.920
I know your Mana Blade is weak 
against physical attacks.

03:13.460 --> 03:15.910
And you think that gives you 
a strategy against me?

03:15.910 --> 03:18.260
If you do, you didn't think 
this through very well.

03:19.760 --> 03:21.710
Well, let's just find out...

03:23.240 --> 03:24.630
if that's true or not.

03:28.800 --> 03:30.280
Icicle Rain!

03:53.700 --> 03:55.550
I fear for our future.

03:56.670 --> 03:58.240
How ironic it is.

03:58.550 --> 04:00.680
No matter how strong you 
demonstrate yourself to be,

04:00.680 --> 04:02.910
you will only be feared by the people.

04:02.910 --> 04:06.390
You'll be called a heretic, 
and no one will recognize your worth.

04:06.990 --> 04:08.890
Which one of us is the heretic?

04:10.110 --> 04:13.890
I know better than anyone 
that I'm a heretic.

04:14.700 --> 04:19.130
You know it yourself, and yet 
you make no effort to change?

04:20.550 --> 04:23.440
What was it you hoped to accomplish, then?

04:23.780 --> 04:27.010
What did you hope to become?

04:29.010 --> 04:30.280
Answer me!

04:30.750 --> 04:34.450
Answer me, Anisphia Wynn Palettia!

04:35.310 --> 04:38.920
I'm just me. I can't become anyone else.

04:39.370 --> 04:41.640
I just had a love for magic, that's all.

04:41.890 --> 04:46.010
Even after all this, you're still 
hiding behind stupid word games?!

04:46.590 --> 04:48.230
You'll just pretend to accept it,

04:48.230 --> 04:51.800
while you keep lying to yourself 
and deceiving those around you?!

04:55.190 --> 04:58.760
You aren't fit for this kingdom.

05:02.050 --> 05:03.540
I know that.

05:04.400 --> 05:08.070
But even if I can't use magic,

05:08.070 --> 05:09.940
I know it's still a sacred thing.

05:10.960 --> 05:13.090
I still have faith.

05:13.090 --> 05:15.350
I believe in magic, and I love it.

05:15.350 --> 05:16.830
I always will!

05:17.170 --> 05:19.920
And that's more than enough 
to make me happy.

05:22.870 --> 05:27.110
Even knowing the thing you 
love will always betray you,

05:27.640 --> 05:29.010
you'd still say that?

05:29.940 --> 05:33.560
You truly are arrogant.

05:35.840 --> 05:39.550
I will surpass you. I <i>have</i> to.

05:40.310 --> 05:42.530
I can't move forward if I don't!

05:48.360 --> 05:51.690
Anisphia!

05:59.680 --> 06:01.580
Eu...phylli...

06:01.580 --> 06:03.000
Please, don't speak!

06:03.290 --> 06:07.000
I... know...

06:08.410 --> 06:10.790
I should... give up...

06:11.480 --> 06:15.360
There's nothing... I can do...

06:15.360 --> 06:19.680
except scream... the way I did...

06:19.680 --> 06:21.550
Scream?

06:21.550 --> 06:23.120
Lady Euphyllia...

06:24.370 --> 06:27.420
If I had blood... magic...

06:27.420 --> 06:29.170
You need blood?! I'll...

06:30.100 --> 06:31.130
No.

06:31.510 --> 06:33.790
Stay as you are, Lady Euphyllia.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.120
I will—

06:41.480 --> 06:43.090
Pardon me.

07:08.710 --> 07:11.890
No... The pain won't go away...

07:13.370 --> 07:16.300
How is Prince Algard able to move?

07:16.300 --> 07:18.200
It hurts! It hurts!

07:17.400 --> 07:20.400
Even after regenerating, 
you still feel pain?

07:48.530 --> 07:50.220
Lady Euphyllia...

07:51.390 --> 07:53.770
Do you not wish to put a stop to this?

07:56.940 --> 07:58.110
I...

08:02.080 --> 08:03.200
Miss Anis!

08:10.360 --> 08:11.390
I broke it!

08:11.390 --> 08:13.170
I smashed the damn thing!

08:16.860 --> 08:19.010
Is this the best you can do, Sister?

08:20.720 --> 08:23.580
Stop fooling around! Look at me!

08:23.580 --> 08:27.390
Am I not even worth existing 
in your field of vision?!

08:29.760 --> 08:31.060
I get it.

08:31.950 --> 08:36.110
You're saying I should 
fight to kill, aren't you?

08:39.280 --> 08:42.650
Aerial Attack: Dragon Heart!

08:46.410 --> 08:47.620
You're such...

08:50.210 --> 08:53.220
a stupid little brother!

09:20.320 --> 09:22.170
Not yet...

09:25.580 --> 09:28.930
I'm... I'm not...

09:42.080 --> 09:43.680
This is...

09:44.370 --> 09:46.920
the end!

09:52.210 --> 09:53.290
<i>Why...</i>

09:57.130 --> 09:59.040
<i>are you looking at me like that?</i>

10:12.670 --> 10:14.080
Euphie?

10:17.460 --> 10:20.590
What good does it do for you two 
to try to kill each other?!

10:20.590 --> 10:22.550
You're both idiots!

10:23.470 --> 10:26.960
You don't want to fight if it means 
having to make that face, do you?!

10:26.960 --> 10:29.320
You didn't want to kill him, did you?!

10:29.810 --> 10:33.190
Yet you kept fighting... 
hurting each other...

10:34.450 --> 10:35.890
Are you a complete fool?!

10:47.280 --> 10:48.310
Al...

10:49.070 --> 10:51.800
It was nice weather.

10:53.140 --> 10:56.590
The skies were clear, so I was looking up.

10:56.590 --> 11:01.410
There's only one person I know 
who'd be up in the sky like that.

11:06.430 --> 11:09.110
Do you remember, Sister?

11:10.700 --> 11:13.680
The day we escaped the castle.

11:14.500 --> 11:15.260
Yeah.

11:16.400 --> 11:18.910
Then we were attacked by a monster.

11:19.740 --> 11:23.910
You stayed behind so I 
could escape, and I ran.

11:24.690 --> 11:26.960
I hid so it wouldn't find me.

11:26.960 --> 11:28.950
I just trembled in fear 
and didn't even breathe.

11:30.960 --> 11:34.980
And you were the one who found me then, too.

11:36.830 --> 11:40.720
You were always leading me by the hand.

11:41.420 --> 11:44.850
You taught me so many things.

11:45.480 --> 11:46.560
I really think

11:47.550 --> 11:50.200
I was still human right up until that day...

11:50.200 --> 11:53.690
Until the day you pushed me away.

11:55.650 --> 11:59.740
<i>It's true. I pushed Al away.</i>

12:00.200 --> 12:02.230
<i>After that monster attacked us,</i>

12:02.820 --> 12:04.690
<i>a rumor started going around.</i>

12:06.780 --> 12:11.850
<i>A rumor that I had tried 
to kill Al out of jealousy.</i>

12:13.090 --> 12:16.970
<i>That's why I renounced 
my right to the throne.</i>

12:17.800 --> 12:19.670
<i>I wanted to prove that I had no interest</i>

12:20.310 --> 12:23.050
<i>in inheriting the throne, 
and no ill intent toward Al.</i>

12:24.710 --> 12:29.170
Sorry about everything. 
You can be the next king now.

12:29.170 --> 12:30.450
So don't worry!

12:42.890 --> 12:44.410
<i>That was the day...</i>

12:45.990 --> 12:48.470
<i>our relationship changed.</i>

12:51.080 --> 12:52.900
Hey, Sister...

12:53.660 --> 12:56.340
Why did you throw away 
your right to the throne?

12:57.090 --> 13:00.690
Why must someone who's 
so much smarter than me,

13:00.690 --> 13:03.170
who can show concern for others,

13:03.170 --> 13:06.040
be scorned as unworthy of the throne?

13:06.780 --> 13:07.900
I...

13:08.230 --> 13:09.510
I know.

13:10.140 --> 13:13.360
But still, you should be queen.

13:13.790 --> 13:15.930
At least, I felt that way sometimes.

13:17.410 --> 13:23.380
But the people who run this 
kingdom will never let you.

13:24.550 --> 13:26.770
A country that denies someone's superiority

13:26.770 --> 13:29.280
and only adheres to old traditions

13:29.810 --> 13:32.720
may have a glorious past, 
but it'll never have a future.

13:33.250 --> 13:34.120
So...

13:34.990 --> 13:37.830
What choice is there 
but to destroy it and start over?

13:38.500 --> 13:39.500
Al...

13:41.140 --> 13:43.610
It'll never be within my reach.

13:44.750 --> 13:49.520
The true genius, the one who 
truly cares for the people,

13:49.520 --> 13:51.920
the one capable of earning 
the proper qualifications...

13:52.460 --> 13:53.740
is you.

13:54.850 --> 13:56.440
Not me.

14:01.350 --> 14:05.100
I shouldn't even have been born.

14:07.220 --> 14:11.490
Because of me, you had to get hurt...

14:12.080 --> 14:14.600
And if it meant you had to be hurt,

14:15.410 --> 14:17.800
if it meant you'd have to feel this way...

14:18.560 --> 14:21.690
I never should have been born...

14:27.120 --> 14:28.210
Sister...

14:31.170 --> 14:36.200
It hurts being unable to become 
what you truly want to be.

15:03.790 --> 15:07.640
Algard, why did you do such a thing?

15:08.160 --> 15:10.290
I have nothing to say,

15:10.720 --> 15:14.430
except that I was a fool.

15:17.110 --> 15:20.440
Then I have no choice but to disinherit you.

15:24.070 --> 15:25.620
Do you resent me?

15:26.410 --> 15:28.970
No. If I harbor any resentment,

15:28.970 --> 15:31.210
it's for this entire world.

15:31.630 --> 15:36.970
I hated everything, from the moment 
I was born up until this day.

15:37.640 --> 15:39.550
Everything, you say?

15:39.550 --> 15:42.150
That's quite the declaration.

15:42.570 --> 15:46.700
No commutations or apologies are 
needed with regard to my punishment.

15:46.700 --> 15:48.380
I will comply with your orders.

15:53.450 --> 15:56.840
You will hereby be exiled 
to the borderlands.

15:56.840 --> 15:59.360
Until your body is reduced to dust,

15:59.360 --> 16:02.670
it will be put to use in service 
of this kingdom. Understood?

16:04.420 --> 16:08.080
I offer my deepest gratitude for 
Your Majesty's great kindness.

16:08.410 --> 16:11.430
"Your Majesty," eh?

16:15.460 --> 16:18.430
I've failed as a mother.

16:18.430 --> 16:22.160
I know I had a part in 
nurturing your resentment.

16:22.870 --> 16:25.210
I'm sorry, Algard.

16:26.810 --> 16:29.110
My sin is my own.

16:29.580 --> 16:32.910
Please, do not worry yourself over me.

16:33.580 --> 16:36.380
I'm sorry I wasn't a better son.

16:48.690 --> 16:50.330
Prince Algard,

16:50.330 --> 16:55.190
could you tell us about the others 
involved in this incident?

16:55.190 --> 16:56.450
Of course.

16:56.450 --> 16:58.390
Then, if you would follow me...

17:07.000 --> 17:08.290
Sister...

17:17.570 --> 17:19.900
Do you... remember this?

17:28.260 --> 17:31.510
"Shake hands and make up," right?

17:39.520 --> 17:40.810
I'm sorry.

17:41.820 --> 17:45.280
<i>If I had just lived a normal 
life in this world,</i>

17:46.070 --> 17:49.240
<i>you wouldn't have suffered so much...</i>

17:50.800 --> 17:51.850
Sister...

17:53.820 --> 17:56.800
Thank you. And I'm sorry.

18:03.980 --> 18:09.300
I'm so sorry I couldn't protect you.

18:19.320 --> 18:22.440
<i>After Prince Algard's 
punishment was decided,</i>

18:22.800 --> 18:28.240
<i>all the plans writhing behind the 
cancellation of his engagement to me,</i>

18:28.240 --> 18:30.180
<i>Euphyllia Magenta, came to light.</i>

18:31.030 --> 18:35.770
<i>It all started when Master Moritz, 
after learning who Lainie was,</i>

18:35.770 --> 18:39.030
<i>discovered some research 
materials about vampires.</i>

18:39.960 --> 18:43.540
<i>As punishment for using her vampire powers</i>

18:43.540 --> 18:48.120
<i>and Prince Algard himself in a plot 
to obtain even greater authority,</i>

18:48.120 --> 18:50.610
<i>the Chartreuse conspirators 
were granted death</i>

18:50.610 --> 18:52.930
<i>for threatening the king's authority.</i>

18:54.780 --> 18:57.580
<i>Those who worked with them 
were also severely punished,</i>

18:57.580 --> 18:59.950
<i>leaving the castle in chaos.</i>

19:00.800 --> 19:02.910
<i>We were not unscathed, either.</i>

19:03.400 --> 19:05.620
<i>Both Miss Anis and Ilia are bedridden.</i>

19:06.340 --> 19:08.570
<i>Only Lainie and I remain healthy.</i>

19:11.160 --> 19:12.240
<i>And then...</i>

19:13.330 --> 19:17.330
<i>the day of Prince Algard's departure 
for the borderlands arrived.</i>

19:33.840 --> 19:36.020
I'm sorry to appear without notice.

19:36.400 --> 19:40.490
Might I speak with Prince 
Algard for a moment?

19:40.490 --> 19:42.050
Er, but...

19:47.960 --> 19:49.660
Um...

19:50.100 --> 19:51.870
Prince Algard...

19:51.870 --> 19:52.840
Lainie...

19:53.720 --> 19:56.610
This was the only choice I had.

19:56.610 --> 19:58.600
Feel free to curse me all you like.

20:03.700 --> 20:06.970
You did do a terrible thing to me.

20:06.970 --> 20:08.600
But it's all right.

20:08.980 --> 20:13.800
I believe the Prince Algard 
who was kind to me is real, too.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.760
Real?

20:17.140 --> 20:20.240
I know you only did all that 
so you could use me.

20:20.720 --> 20:23.770
But I felt happy...

20:23.770 --> 20:27.540
So I don't think that kindness was a lie!

20:28.460 --> 20:33.000
But it still hurt very much, and I 
suffered a lot, so I won't forgive you.

20:33.000 --> 20:34.430
I'll despise you forever.

20:35.630 --> 20:38.250
Yes. I'll always remember, too...

20:38.560 --> 20:41.460
To be both apologetic and grateful to you.

20:47.250 --> 20:50.890
Euphyllia, I need to apologize to you, too.

20:51.520 --> 20:53.560
I know you probably don't believe that...

20:53.560 --> 20:56.070
No, that's not...

20:56.070 --> 20:58.080
It's fine. Don't put up a front.

20:58.470 --> 21:02.160
Though I suppose, for you, 
that just came naturally.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.970
You're the duke's genius daughter, after all.

21:06.400 --> 21:09.000
But you can't be someone's 
fiancée like that.

21:09.000 --> 21:11.960
It's despicable. Not lovable at all.

21:13.340 --> 21:16.160
How very rude you are.

21:16.950 --> 21:18.290
Prince Algard...

21:18.290 --> 21:20.730
Please forgive this one act of indiscretion.

21:21.150 --> 21:24.390
I've already been disinherited. 
Do whatever you want to me.

21:31.950 --> 21:33.360
That really stings.

21:33.720 --> 21:36.570
In truth, I considered 
using my fist instead,

21:36.570 --> 21:37.740
but I couldn't, of course.

21:40.360 --> 21:42.080
That's for the best.

21:42.080 --> 21:45.440
There's no one who'd say you're 
like a little doll anymore.

21:46.440 --> 21:49.750
No... If I could have faced 
the problem properly,

21:49.750 --> 21:51.780
perhaps I would have found another way.

21:52.200 --> 21:55.000
I do apologize for falling short.

21:55.660 --> 22:00.430
That said, you were absolutely 
deplorable as a fiancé.

22:01.770 --> 22:05.640
I'm impressed we both kept up that 
horrible engagement for so long.

22:10.820 --> 22:11.950
It's time.

22:12.390 --> 22:15.770
I had hoped to apologize to Ilia 
in person, as well, but...

22:16.310 --> 22:18.240
I'll pass that along to her.

22:25.140 --> 22:26.400
Also...

22:26.730 --> 22:30.460
I know I'm really in no position 
to ask this of you, but...

22:33.540 --> 22:35.870
Take care of my sister.

22:58.290 --> 23:01.480
A reaction to the seal on your back, is it?

23:03.090 --> 23:07.210
I only helped you because 
you said it was safe.

23:09.270 --> 23:10.670
Miss Anis?

23:11.940 --> 23:15.210
Al... I'm sorry...

23:18.890 --> 23:20.220
Miss Anis...

23:21.010 --> 23:22.710
Have pleasant dreams.

23:24.640 --> 23:28.040
I'll be here beside you.

23:32.220 --> 23:34.970
Episode Nine







The Sister and Brother, and for 
Whom the Crown Is Intended

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
Episode Ten







The Royal Succession of Resignation and Fury
